{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "All video games must be available to purchase as a physical, complete version",
        "additional_details": "A physical copy of a game allows you to have ownership of the game.\r\nIt allows you to share the game with friends and family.\r\nHaving a physical game allows you to sell it and supports business that sell 2nd hand games.\r\n2nd hand games can help those on low incomes to purchase games.\r\n",
        "background": "Game developers when releasing a new game must provide a physical copy either disc or USB key. This media must be transferable and saleable.",
